#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shares {groups} with compatible paired machines."
msgstr "Синхронизирует {groups} с совместимыми сопряжёнными компьютерами."

#: core/settings_sync.py
msgid "Resistance, drag protection and Shortcut stay in step. Ways and jump keys below are local; each side is shared with its paired machine."
